<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $1 million Stuttgart clay-court men's tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>14-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 3-6 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany) 6-7 (4-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat Alexander Radulescu (Germany) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Daniel Elsner (Germany) 6-3 6-4  </p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Marc Goellner (Germany) 7-5 6-1  </p>
<p>8-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany) 6-7 (4-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>14-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Martin Sinner (Germany)</p>
<p>3-6 6-0 6-4</p>
</text>
